            alt: "the local-space plot with one hostile picked and its range and bearing under it",
        ),
        body: "The MAP app plots every contact around you as a labelled blip: SELF, ALLY-1, HOST-1, OBJ-1, AST-1. Pick one and the readout gives its kind, name, range and bearing. Setting GOTO from here engages the autopilot directly, without taking a radar lock.",
        actions: [
